OL,3,GNEWSAPrisoner jailed over sex messages
OL,4,Ato 13-year-old
OL,5,
OL,6,FA paedophile prisoner who sent
OL,7,Fsexualised messages to a 13-year-old
OL,8,Fgirl from a prison has been jailed for
OL,9,Fthree years.
OL,11,FMartin Mills, 38, was using a mobile
OL,12,Fphone which had been sneaked into North
OL,13,FSea Camp Open Prison at Freiston, near
OL,14,FBoston, Lincolnshire.
OL,16,FA statement from the victim's mother
OL,17,Fsaid her daughter had self-harmed and
OL,18,Fneeded counselling after Mills'
OL,19,Fmessages "lured her to very dark
OL,20,Fplaces".
